registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
@banbolee:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/

# The DSH dependency family is pinned to ONE prerelease (AGENTS.md: `@deepseek-ai/*`
# ^0.1.5-rc.2). A caret range on a prerelease drifts to the newest rc.x the moment
# upstream publishes one — 0.1.5-rc.3 did exactly that and broke the repository's own
# family-coherence assertion. The root `pnpm.overrides` block therefore pins every
# `@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` package in the graph; keep that list complete, because a package
# left out of it is free to drift again.
